# P3 ride-along, both models: clean VAR and DiT baselines only (no removal arms) on manifest v1.1
# (224 images), with P3's observe hooks attached (lanes/p3/p3_observe.py: var_stages, dit_stages).
#     qsub -v SETTINGS=lanes/p1/jobs/p3_both.env lanes/p1/jobs/gateb.pbs
# Expected: VAR 140 .npz (10 scales x 14 batches, ~70 MB) in outputs/p1/<JOBID>/p3_var_stages,
#           DiT 336 .npz (24 steps x 14 batches, ~90 MB) in outputs/p1/<JOBID>/p3_dit_stages.
# Both baselines must still match outputs/baseline/25665469 row by row (Observe hooks change nothing).
# Estimated: ~76 s VAR + ~486 s DiT baseline, plus snapshot writes (+ job start-up): well under 02:00.
# Then: python -m lanes.p1.compare_p3_var outputs/p1/25891860/p3_var_stages outputs/p1/<JOBID>/p3_var_stages
MANIFEST=manifest/frozen_v1_1.csv
EXP_TAG=p3both
RUN_VAR=1
RUN_DIT=1
VAR_ARMS=""
DIT_ARMS=""
P3_RIDEALONG=1
QUALITY=0
KEEP_RAW=0
